     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-10 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Delhi Police Detain Cockroach Janta Party Leaders on Aircraft</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Delhi Police detained Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) founder Abhijeet Dipke and co-conveners Saurabh Das and Ashutosh Ranka inside their aircraft upon arrival at Delhi airport from Mumbai. The preventative detention occurred ahead of a planned march to Jantar Mantar, which authorities had prohibited.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-10/delhi-police-detain-cockroach-janta-party-leaders-on-aircraf.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Security forces enforced strict movement restrictions across central Delhi, including barricades and the deployment of personnel across 20 sectors. Police utilized Section 163 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita to disperse gatherings and restrict public transit, citing concerns over potential vandalism and unauthorized mass mobilizations near key government areas.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief provides a concise, accurate summary of the detention and the security measures described in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/video/delhi-police-detain-cockroach-janta-party-leaders-inside-aircraft-at-airport-ytvd-3013918-2026-10-10?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/delhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Delhi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-10/delhi-police-detain-cockroach-janta-party-leaders-on-aircraf" data-title="Delhi Police Detain Cockroach Janta Party Leaders on Aircraft"><b>Share:</b>
