      <a href="/wire">Wire</a>
      <a href="/stats">Stats</a>
      <a href="/feed.xml" title="RSS">RSS</a>
      <button id="tdp-theme" title="Toggle light/dark">Light</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/national">national</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-10 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge conf" title="Reported by News18 India, India Today">confirmed by 2 sources</span></div>
       <h1>India Rejects UN Rights Body Remarks on Delhi Protests</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Indian government has dismissed concerns from the UN Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) regarding recent events in New Delhi, labeling the comments as &quot;misplaced&quot; and &quot;unwarranted interference&quot; in domestic affairs. India emphasized that its constitutional framework guarantees peaceful assembly, subject to reasonable public order restrictions, and that its independent judiciary remains available for grievance redressal.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-10/india-rejects-un-rights-body-remarks-on-delhi-protests.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Furthermore, the Indian mission at the UN in Geneva urged the OHCHR to maintain impartiality and non-selectivity by focusing on large-scale protests globally. Officials reiterated that Indian authorities act strictly in accordance with the law.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately summarizes the official Indian government response to the OHCHR, covering both the rejection of the remarks and the specific rationale provided.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source · also covered by 1 more</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/unwarranted-interference-india-hits-back-at-un-rights-body-over-delhi-protest-remarks-10376506.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/unwarranted-interference-indias-sharp-response-to-un-rights-body-over-remarks-on-delhi-protest-crackdown-3014514-2026-10-10?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>This brief was written from the original report. The same event was independently covered by the other outlets listed here.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/delhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Delhi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-10/india-rejects-un-rights-body-remarks-on-delhi-protests" data-title="India Rejects UN Rights Body Remarks on Delhi Protests"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
