       <h1>Indian Olympic Association Sets Election Date</h1>
       
       <p>The Indian Olympic Association (IOA) announced on Saturday that it will hold elections for its new Executive Council on December 5. This crucial date has been set as the current committee's term is slated to conclude just five days later.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-10/indian-olympic-association-sets-election-date.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The upcoming election will determine the leadership that will guide the IOA forward, marking a significant transition for the national sports body. The process is expected to ensure a smooth handover of responsibilities.</p><p>What to watch: The candidates and outcomes of the upcoming Executive Council elections.</p>
