<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Lyrical Evangelist Ezra Sastry Dies at 72 — The Daily Prompt</title>
<meta name="description" content="Renowned lyrical evangelist and musician Ezra Sastry passed away from cardiac arrest at a Secunderabad hospital on Saturday at age 72. A prominent fig">
