      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/mcc-clarifies-new-run-out-rule-amid-confusion-confirms-non-striker-run-outs-remain-valid-5530/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
