      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/riyadh-airport-evacuated-after-reported-fresh-attack-say-officials-126101000780_1.html" rel="noopener">Business Standard</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
