     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-10 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Pune Students Protest Government Job Recruitment Issues</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Hundreds of students are protesting in Pune over corruption in the Maharashtra Public Service Commission (MPSC) recruitment process, including repeated exam paper leaks. Protesters demand the resignation of the MPSC chairman, the filling of 70,000 government vacancies, and a more transparent, affordable examination system.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-10/pune-students-protest-government-job-recruitment-issues.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Demonstrators gathering on the S.M. Bridge face significant uncertainty, with many fearing that police notices and participation in protests could negatively impact their future job prospects. While organizers face legal action for unlawful assembly, students continue to demand accountability, highlighting the economic hardships and systemic challenges facing those seeking state government service positions.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Covers the protest drivers, student concerns, and the systemic issues mentioned in the source effectively.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/maharashtra/pune-protest-maharashtra-public-service-commission-mpsc-paper-leak-ground-zero/article71564646.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/pune/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pune</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
