     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-10 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Three Bangladeshi Nationals Arrested in Kozhikode for Forged Documents</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Kozhikode police have arrested three Bangladeshi nationals for residing and working in India using forged identity documents. Roshnara Begum, Papiya, and Rabbi Ripun were taken into custody following a physical altercation near a hotel in Vellayil that prompted a police investigation.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-10/three-bangladeshi-nationals-arrested-in-kozhikode-for-forged.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Authorities discovered the suspects had procured fake Aadhaar, PAN, and Voter ID cards using Kolkata addresses. The investigation revealed Ripun worked as a welder, while the two women were employed at local spas. Preliminary findings confirmed their illegal status and the fraudulent nature of their credentials, which were stored on their mobile devices.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively captures the core facts of the arrests and the nature of the forged documents without unnecessary padding.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/three-bangladeshi-nationals-jailed-in-kozhikode-for-using-forged-ids/article71567149.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/kozhikode/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kozhikode</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
